    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャーン
道具屋「猫目」ニャーン</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nyaan. This is the
item shop, "Cat's
Eye," nyaan.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269988</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうぞ、見てって～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Take a look around~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ニャーン</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nyaan.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレは「シグルド」って
陽気な集まりの
一員さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm a member of
"Sigurd." We're all
pretty cheerful guys.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうだい？
子どもでも歓迎だ。
一緒に来ないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about it? Even
kids're welcome. Want
to come join us?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「シグルド」は荒くれだが、
愉快なヤツばかりだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can be rowdy at Sigurd, but pretty
much everyone's a real great guy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>歌も踊りも
上手いのさ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good at singing
and dancing, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アイドル集団？
ははっ、かもな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Almost like a group
of idols. Haha.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「シグルド」は地上にはびこる
魔物どもから人々を
守る集団だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are a lot of monsters
in the world these days, and
Sigurd protect people from 'em.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレたちは
ネグラを持たねぇ
町から町へ渡る渡り鳥さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We haven't got a home base,
so we travel from town
to town, like migratin' birds.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔物からの護衛なら
オレたちに任せな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you need protectin' from
monsters, we're your guys!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ただし、
代金はいただくけどな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, we do have
to get paid, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレは「シグルド」の一員だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm a member of "Sigurd"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なに？　シグルドが
犯罪集団だって？
バカ言っちゃいけない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What? Sigurd's a
criminal group?
Stop spouting bull!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「シグルド」は犯罪集団じゃない！
そりゃちょっとは
暴力的なヤツもいるが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Sigurd" aren't criminals!
Sure, some of us can
get a bit violent, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>義理と人情で世を渡る
熱い男たちの集まりだぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're just a bunch of guys
with a sense of duty and
empathy, travelin' the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
